{"id": "50262", "title": "堕落之后", "author": "萦绕", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 50, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/50/50262.htm", "intro": "曾有人说过，黑暗很快会过去的，\r\n光明会来到的，天使将在空中为你指引……\r\n她的天使呢，光明呢？！\r\n不她没有，她早被神所遗弃，在遇到那些恶魔时，\r\n就注定了她没有天堂，她只有地狱，\r\n她身边没有指引的天使，\r\n只有披着天使外衣的狰狞恶魔！\r\n评： 喜欢林音，为她心痛，开始感觉好惨，我就没看下去了，直接跳到结局去了，虽然说结局是好的，但还是感到遗憾，女猪脚受了那么多苦，是NP辣文，记不清是那两个双胞胎了===", "base": "files/article/html/50/50262", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "7182714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "7182716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "7182718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "7182720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "7182722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "7182724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "7182727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "7182729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "7182731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "7182733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "7182734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "7182736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "7182738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "7182740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "7182743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "7182745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "7182747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "7182748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "7182749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "7182750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "7182752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "7182753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "7182756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "7182759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "7182760.htm